    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42747" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρυθραί</span></b> , αἱ,
			<u>Erythrae</u> in Ionia, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			1.142
		</span></i>, etc.; locat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρυθρᾶσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.10.14
				</span></i>
			:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρυθραϊκὸν</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σατύριον,</span>
			<i>Serapias cordigera,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.128
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				26.97
			</span></i>:—but <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρυθριὰς</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span> is 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρετριάς</span>
			, Heras ap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.545
			</span></i>.</div>
